ar apart, the Discovery (DIS) set and the Validation (VAL) set. DIS consisted of 65 specimens analyzed including 30 tumors; VAL consisted of 63 specimens analyzed including 32 tumors . Overall, there are 128 independent scRNA-seq datasets on 62 tumors. 70,691 cells from DIS and 71,374 cells from VAL (total: 142,065) were retained after filtering for high-quality barcodes using dropkick. In addition, 7051 cells high-quality cells from seven (two MSI-H, five MSS) fresh CRC specimen are included in the Abnormal dataset together with polyp cells extracted from DIS and VAL. Specimens were collected from diverse sex, racial, and age groups.","doi":"10.1016/j.cell.2021.11.031","is_pre_analysis":false,"links":[{"link_name":"","link_type":"OTHER","link_url":"https://explore.data.humancellatlas.org/projects/50154d1e-2308-44bf-9608-10c7afaa560b"},{"link_name":"phs002371","link_type":"RAW_DATA","link_url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs002371"},{"link_name":"","link_type":"OTHER","link_url":"https://humantumoratlas.org/explore"}],"name":"HTAN VUMC - Differential pre-malignant programs and microenvironment chart distinct paths to malignancy in human colorectal polyps","published_at":"2022-09-26T18:00:38+00:00","publisher_metadata":{"authors":[{"family":"Chen","given":"Bob"},{"family":"Scurrah","given":"Cherie\u2019 R."},{"family":"McKinley","given":"Eliot T."},{"family":"Simmons","given":"Alan J."},{"family":"Ramirez-Solano","given":"Marisol A."},{"family":"Zhu","given":"Xiangzhu"},{"family":"Markham","given":"Nicholas O."},{"family":"Heiser","given":"Cody N."},{"family":"Vega","given":"Paige N."},{"family":"Rolong","given":"Andrea"},{"family":"Kim","given":"Hyeyon"},{"family":"Sheng","given":"Quanhu"},{"family":"Drewes","given":"Julia L."},{"family":"Zhou","given":"Yuan"},{"family":"Southard-Smith","given":"Austin N."},{"family":"Xu","given":"Yanwen"},{"family":"Ro","given":"James"},{"family":"Jones","given":"Angela L."},{"family":"Reve